WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.266 --> 00:00:01.735 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Now, I've got to share
some of my favorite

00:00:01.735 --> 00:00:02.769 align:start size:94% position:6%
airport fail stories
from you guys.

00:00:02.769 --> 00:00:06.473 align:start size:94% position:6%
Here we go. This first one
is from @Bamabeano.

00:00:06.473 --> 00:00:07.340 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Ooh.

00:00:07.340 --> 00:00:10.110 align:start size:94% position:6%
-He says, "I was running late
for a connecting flight

00:00:10.110 --> 00:00:11.077 align:start size:94% position:6%
that was leaving
in five minutes.

00:00:11.077 --> 00:00:13.113 align:start size:94% position:6%
So, I had to race from
gate A to gate G.

00:00:13.113 --> 00:00:15.782
Halfway there I realized someone
was yelling out to me,

00:00:15.782 --> 00:00:17.550 size:75% position:38% line:92%
'Run, Forest, run!'"

00:00:17.550 --> 00:00:20.520 size:84% position:42% line:92%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:20.520 --> 00:00:22.222 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Bamabeano.

00:00:22.222 --> 00:00:24.290 align:start size:94% position:6%
-This one is from
@colleenm.

00:00:24.290 --> 00:00:26.860 align:start size:94% position:6%
She says, "I was fiddling with
the side of my plane seat

00:00:26.860 --> 00:00:29.162
and grabbed something I thought
was the recliner handle.

00:00:29.162 --> 00:00:31.931
Then I realized I had decided to
stretch out behind me.

00:00:31.931 --> 00:00:34.134 line:92%
I had grabbed a bare foot."

00:00:34.134 --> 00:00:36.569 line:92%
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:00:36.569 --> 00:00:39.272 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Oh.

00:00:39.272 --> 00:00:40.607 line:92%
-This one is from @Deanna MAD.

00:00:40.607 --> 00:00:44.844
She says, "I took an edible
while waiting at the airport.

00:00:44.844 --> 00:00:46.312 align:start size:94% position:6%
Ended up missing
my flight on purpose

00:00:46.312 --> 00:00:48.948 align:start size:94% position:6%
because I was too relaxed and
wanted to finish watching

00:00:48.948 --> 00:00:50.817 line:92%
'The Great British Bake Off.'"

00:00:50.817 --> 00:00:52.485 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:00:52.485 --> 00:00:54.220 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Applause ]

00:00:54.220 --> 00:00:59.459
Hawaii is not going anywhere.
Hawaii is not going anywhere.

00:00:59.459 --> 00:01:02.595 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Oh, wait. A foot.

00:01:02.595 --> 00:01:04.731 line:92%
-This one is from @Le Marz.

00:01:04.731 --> 00:01:07.700
She says, "my brother and I were
at a self-check-in machine

00:01:07.700 --> 00:01:09.135 align:start size:94% position:6%
when a woman behind us
asked for help.

00:01:09.135 --> 00:01:11.738
After that, everyone thought
we were airport employees.

00:01:11.738 --> 00:01:15.775
We were there for three hours
checking people into Toronto.

00:01:15.775 --> 00:01:21.181 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Applause ]

00:01:21.181 --> 00:01:23.750 line:92%
This one is from @wford22.

00:01:23.750 --> 00:01:26.219 align:start size:94% position:6%
He says, "I was walking in
the airport to my gate

00:01:26.219 --> 00:01:28.188 align:start size:94% position:6%
when a little kid ran
past me yelling,

00:01:28.188 --> 00:01:30.290 line:92%
'The poop is coming out!'"

00:01:30.290 --> 00:01:33.726 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:33.726 --> 00:01:37.230 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Aw!
-Run, Forest, run!

00:01:37.230 --> 00:01:39.365 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:39.365 --> 00:01:40.900 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Gate number two.

00:01:40.900 --> 00:01:45.872 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:45.872 --> 00:01:47.974 line:92%
-This one is from @BohemianJenn.

00:01:47.974 --> 00:01:51.244
She says, "A legit clown once
sat next to me on a plane.

00:01:51.244 --> 00:01:53.646
When we made eye contact, he
felt the need to assure me

00:01:53.646 --> 00:01:57.183 align:start size:94% position:6%
that he was a good clown,
not a creepy clown."

00:01:57.183 --> 00:01:59.452 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Applause ]

00:01:59.452 --> 00:02:01.454 align:start size:94% position:6%
Or is that what a creepy clown
would say

00:02:01.454 --> 00:02:03.456 line:92%
to trick you in to thinking.

00:02:03.456 --> 00:02:06.459 line:92%
This one's from @Danielita89.

00:02:06.459 --> 00:02:09.562
She says, "I fell asleep during
a long layover and woke up to

00:02:09.562 --> 00:02:11.798 size:84% position:42%
a little girl poking me
and asking out aloud,

00:02:11.798 --> 00:02:13.600 size:84% position:42% line:92%
'Mommy, is she alive?'"

00:02:13.600 --> 00:02:16.236 line:92%
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:02:16.236 --> 00:02:20.206 align:start size:94% position:6%
Leave the dead lady alone,
sweetheart.

00:02:20.206 --> 00:02:22.575 align:start size:94% position:6%
Last one is from
@KatyByrneDesign.

00:02:22.575 --> 00:02:25.879
She said, "I once sat next to a
man who slammed two servings

00:02:25.879 --> 00:02:26.746 line:92%
of nachos right after takeoff.

00:02:26.746 --> 00:02:29.616 align:start size:94% position:6%
Later, when the flight hit
turbulence he started yelling,

00:02:29.616 --> 00:02:31.784 line:92%
'This isn't going to end well!'"

00:02:31.784 --> 00:02:32.418 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
There you have it.

00:02:32.418 --> 00:02:33.820 align:start size:94% position:6%
